An '''impound dock''' was located in a [[Saleucami town|spaceport town]] on the [[planet]] [[Saleucami]] at the beginning of the [[Imperial Era]]. Controlled by the [[Galactic Empire]], impounded [[starship]]s were brought to the lot, where they were secured with magnetic [[Boot (technology)|boots]] for later verification of their signatures. [[Tech]] and [[Echo]] of the fugitive [[Clone Force 99]] intentionally had their [[shuttle]], the [[Marauder (Omicron-class)|''Marauder'']], impounded at the lot as part of a plan to forge the [[Lawquane family|Lawquanes]] [[chain code]]s so they could leave Saleucami, which resulted in a [[Skirmish at Saleucami town|firefight]] between the [[squad]] and Imperial [[clone trooper]]s.<ref name="Cut and Run" />

